### 2. Sử dụng Reverse Proxy (Nginx/Traefik)

**Nginx Reverse Proxy Config:**
```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name maf.yourdomain.com;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```

