TUNNEL_ID=e20b0b88-6187-4869-9063-eba523eaea2b
N8N_HOST=api.maf.run
APP_DOMAIN=app.maf.run
```

### 5. Verify Configuration

```bash
# Test docker-compose configuration
docker compose config

# Should show no errors
```

