## 🚀 DEPLOYMENT STEPS

### Step 1: Build Images

```bash
# Build MAF App image
docker compose build maf-app

# Verify image created
docker images | grep maf-app
```

### Step 2: Start Services

```bash
# Start all services in background
docker compose up -d

# Expected output:
# [+] Running 5/5
#  ✔ Network maf_network            Created
