## ✓ POST-DEPLOYMENT VERIFICATION

### 1. Check Service Status

```bash
# Check all containers are running
docker compose ps

# Expected output (all should be "Up" and "healthy"):
# NAME                       STATUS
# maf-app                    Up (healthy)
