# 3. Build lại và start
docker-compose up -d --build

# 4. Check logs
docker-compose logs -f maf-app
```

### Option 2: Quick rebuild
```bash
# Rebuild với no cache
docker-compose build --no-cache maf-app
docker-compose up -d maf-app
```

